Mbed TLS 4.1.0 (with TF-PSA-Crypto 1.1.0) for THE WRLD OS

Source: the official release archive
  https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/download/mbedtls-4.1.0/mbedtls-4.1.0.tar.bz2
  SHA-256 377a09cf8eb81b5fb2707045e5522d5489d3309fed5006c9874e60558fc81d10

Kept, unmodified: LICENSE, README.md, include/, library/, and from tf-psa-crypto/:
LICENSE, include/, core/, dispatch/, platform/, utilities/, extras/, drivers/builtin/.
Left out: tests, programs, docs, scripts, the build-system files (CMakeLists.txt,
*.make, Makefile) and the optional drivers (everest, p256-m, pqcp/ML-DSA).

The configuration is in ../mbedtls-config (selected with MBEDTLS_CONFIG_FILE and
TF_PSA_CRYPTO_CONFIG_FILE in the Makefile); the glue is src/tls/tls.c.
